{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tan, a boy with a mysterious past who wakes in a Boundscape called <strong>Sanctuary Valley</strong><i>, </i>a tranquil world of rolling hills and calm. A world meant for rest and comfort. But the longer he stays, the more he see the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beloved Bound is a cozy, story-driven adventure focused on exploration, atmosphere, and emotional storytelling. The game encourages players to slow down, observe, and discover things naturally, with minimal UI and no pressure to rush. Expect environmental puzzles, character interactions, and small details that reward curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/ed0e9cc8d96bd28d7ae6446c5c7294db.avif?t=1772919719\" width=386 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow Starlight plants, fish with enchanted bait, tackle platforming challenges, help the neighbors with their unusual requests and earn their trust. This world seems safe and warm, and maybe, just... maybe, it's a life worth staying for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/77c01c899c2d6342ce6e1758258a80a8.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/77c01c899c2d6342ce6e1758258a80a8.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/77c01c899c2d6342ce6e1758258a80a8.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the warmth lies a hidden purpose. To break free, you must solve environmental puzzles and mini-games, gather hidden clues and confront your own reflection, literally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven adventure with environmental puzzle-solving and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/e6859d826af16204b106f0df4bd13e2c.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/e6859d826af16204b106f0df4bd13e2c.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/e6859d826af16204b106f0df4bd13e2c.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games woven into the story - platforming, fishing, memory,\u00a0 puzzles, rhythm, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/1ee072cf7de92c0a39421c535ce8831b.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/1ee072cf7de92c0a39421c535ce8831b.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/1ee072cf7de92c0a39421c535ce8831b.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of scenes: cozy cottage, natural valleys, dark dream worlds, or even a shattered world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/7907771443932457504f6d2677f84320.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/7907771443932457504f6d2677f84320.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/7907771443932457504f6d2677f84320.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/4eeff4f3be9a6f472722e839f4a45903.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/4eeff4f3be9a6f472722e839f4a45903.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/4eeff4f3be9a6f472722e839f4a45903.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable casts, each with backstories and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/cdbdffe484a08620597783a3cf3dd044.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=446 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/cdbdffe484a08620597783a3cf3dd044.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by retro adventures and various storytelling games, <strong>Beloved Bound</strong> invites players to solve mysteries, bond with unlikely friends, and follow Tan as he faces the choice between staying in paradise or returning to his reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/685f2ba8c66bdf12a83a0031f76f24a3.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/685f2ba8c66bdf12a83a0031f76f24a3.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/685f2ba8c66bdf12a83a0031f76f24a3.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886970?t=1772919719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/f4b296a9b63fed7980eab02d7b0f12db225c7157/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772919719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/f37526d9aea6fe5fa401e02761eec8cd6e48dc20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772919719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/f37526d9aea6fe5fa401e02761eec8cd6e48dc20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772919719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Beloved Bound covers serious topics like difficult childhood experiences, war, loss, and questions of identity. The game mentions children in war, trying to survive in tough situations, and dealing with feelings about death and memories. There is no graphic violence or sexual content."},"demos":[{"appid":4023390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tan, a boy with a mysterious past who wakes in a Boundscape called <strong>Sanctuary Valley</strong><i>, </i>a tranquil world of rolling hills and calm. A world meant for rest and comfort. But the longer he stays, the more he see the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beloved Bound is a cozy, story-driven adventure focused on exploration, atmosphere, and emotional storytelling. The game encourages players to slow down, observe, and discover things naturally, with minimal UI and no pressure to rush. Expect environmental puzzles, character interactions, and small details that reward curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/ed0e9cc8d96bd28d7ae6446c5c7294db.avif?t=1772919719\" width=386 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow Starlight plants, fish with enchanted bait, tackle platforming challenges, help the neighbors with their unusual requests and earn their trust. This world seems safe and warm, and maybe, just... maybe, it's a life worth staying for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/77c01c899c2d6342ce6e1758258a80a8.poster.avif?t=1772919719\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/77c01c899c2d6342ce6e1758258a80a8.webm?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886970/extras/77c01c899c2d6342ce6e1758258a80a8.mp4?t=1772919719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath the warmth lies a hidden purpose. To break free, you must solve environmental puzzles and mini-games, gather hidden clues and confront your own reflection, literally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven adventure with environmental puzzle-solving and e